NAME
    gcloud beta backup-dr backups restore - manage restore operations for
        resources

SYNOPSIS
    gcloud beta backup-dr backups restore COMMAND [GCLOUD_WIDE_FLAG ...]

DESCRIPTION
    (BETA) Manage restore operations for resources.

GCLOUD WIDE FLAGS
    These flags are available to all commands: --help.

    Run $ gcloud help for details.

COMMANDS
    COMMAND is one of the following:

     compute
        (BETA) Restores a Compute Engine VM Backup.

     disk
        (BETA) Restores a Compute Disk Backup.

NOTES
    This command is currently in beta and might change without notice. These
    variants are also available:

        $ gcloud backup-dr backups restore

        $ gcloud alpha backup-dr backups restore

